  "review": {
    "images": "Eight original renders from the official Nakheel final-release brochure. The wider waterfront aerial is identified as a district view.",
    "location": "The Nakheel regional diagram marks Bay Grove on Island B. The map link on the corporate project page resolves to the separate Bay Villas development. Named directions and the branded Bay Grove map avoid assigning the other development’s marker. Six travel estimates are from the official Bay Grove location panel.",
    "floorPlans": "All 150 residence sheets from the four original public Nakheel plan books. Phase 1 has 51, Phase 2 has 22, Phase 3 has 36 and Phase 4 has 41. The displayed areas use each visible total column, including the Phase 1 Type M printed range, the Phase 2 Type C smaller row, the Phase 3 Type B duplex total, and Phase 4 Type 1 versus Type 7. Type titles and duplex levels were reviewed against rendered sheets because some PDF text layers include duplicate or inaccurate captions and cells."
  },
